{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_title", "source_sha256": "a9d77be98e24d7b52e549887c9b840317a899cd751d8a2f193351f98ca62d6d1", "ja": "私たちのThank You!", "zh": "我们的Thank You!", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d23afe2a06cc7f06f6335ca3166c96faed0601875e4c4daf83e66ad834c207d1", "ja": "『アイフェス』に向けて、39プロジェクト\nのアイドル達は、会場の下見をして気合いを\nいれる。全体練習ではお互いに意見を出し合\nい、たくさんの人に感謝を届けるため最高の\nパフォーマンスを追求していく。", "zh": "面向“偶像祭”，39 Project\n的偶像们视察了演出场地，鼓足了干劲。\n在全体练习中，大家互相交换意见，\n为了向更多人传达感谢之情，\n不断追求着最棒的舞台表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "647080c0ade8fccc643f3b98050691df5919443afa9e2710197310548c2fc303", "ja": "（『アイフェス』に向けて、今日は会場の下見。そして\n午後は大型スタジオに移動して、初の全体練習がある）", "zh": "（为了『偶像节』，今天要去确认会场。下午还要转移到大型摄影棚，进行首次全员练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "27c496081971a9896d53724d124ce354cd9b79de898e5f071f50d66ebb99866e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、救護室も\n確認してきました。それから避難経路も。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我也去确认过\n救护室了。还有避难路线也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aadccea109dec64ef99b27792b4701f1d4947b4c3e64f86529d1e7224ff59bdc", "ja": "ありがとう。いつもながら、風花がそういう忘れがちな\nところに気付いてくれるから、助かるよ。", "zh": "谢谢。还得是风花，总能注意到这些容易被忽略的地方，帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4be287bf6d67690aea0896fdccef49c385767ddc47b7b6c98d259cc6749e3c9c", "ja": "そんな、私が勝手に気にしてるだけで……。\nあっ、それより、昴ちゃんとのり子ちゃんは？", "zh": "没什么，只是我自己忍不住在意而已……\n啊，对了，昴和则子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f5fa83c74c1c56f4f5870fcf72fcd62a6c347323dd37d1713c9a40a3e93ea0b5", "ja": "ああ、そろそろだと思うけど……うん？", "zh": "啊，我想应该差不多要到了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1005_se", "source_sha256": "fbb0d6ff053a78c0b9f1a9f28f75a707917063399d36015b887c1d768bdeb3ae", "ja": "ブロロロロ……キキーッ！", "zh": "轰隆隆……吱——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "bbab50c1ce8e071be08126ce18b238620c61bf71de1a7d92e43897f5023d03a2", "ja": "{$P$}、風花、お疲れー！\nのり子のバイク、すっげー気持ちよかったよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，风花，辛苦啦！\n乘坐风花的摩托车，感觉超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "336857d846dff7398254170f98324f77924389e84808425964267102fe020655", "ja": "ごめんね、遅くなっちゃった！\nなんか思ったより、道が混んでてさ～。", "zh": "对不起，来晚了！\n没想到路上比想象中还堵～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4271e448ac5aa03987e74f07320132242498a1c8cb41047d9272eff1cab43fc0", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。それで昴、忘れ物を取りに戻るって\nいってたけど、結局なんだったんだ？", "zh": "没事的。话说回来，昴之前说要回去拿忘带的东西，\n结果拿的是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "76085d5ab4d31585150a17c20eeecc10b3989d76575cdfea5981bd1d9836015b", "ja": "もしかして……その大きなクーラーボックス？", "zh": "难道是……那个大大的保冷箱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "d8939db65bd731a8c31132e327c30639d174aa05373479c3112dfc0ccc24d7a2", "ja": "そうそう、レモンのはちみつ漬けを作ってきたんだ。\n練習の時、みんなで食べようと思ってさ！", "zh": "对对，我做了些蜂蜜腌柠檬带过来。\n想着练习的时候大家一起吃嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "dff39b3ce828ea925ad7227bc85592f4b786698b9f7844ad285f1350ddd880a6", "ja": "そんな大きなモノ、なんで忘れるかな～。\nアタシがバイクだったから良かったけどさ。", "zh": "那么大的东西，怎么会忘了呢～  \n幸好我骑的是摩托车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "f131a9f9a7c29ba46149439df2d7c57690b96bfeb0c551d7766c6e1b8afd6063", "ja": "だから、ごめんってば～。のり子のおかげで、\nマジで助かったよ。サンキュな！", "zh": "所以都说了，对不起嘛～。多亏了则子，真的帮大忙了。谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "e170472e5eecd52e7688b9f2065a66f674636ede93ad7d93ef733f78957eea8c", "ja": "うん、わかってるならよろしい！\nはちみつ漬け、アタシの分オマケしてよね♪", "zh": "嗯，心里有数就行！\n蜂蜜渍柠檬，可得多给我留点哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1adc5c165e31ebf3193e88b88f911e59d6364f74e0cd567cc86d415b14159c35", "ja": "なるほど、差し入れはありがたいな。でも、\nまずは下見だ。他のみんなはもう終わってるぞ？", "zh": "原来如此，慰问品确实很不错。不过，先去看看场地。其他人都已经结束了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "cf3618640a16a9eaa6545cefac998c01d68c800962310a359f23fa1343009dbd", "ja": "うわ、マジで！？　ゴメンのり子、風花！\nレモンいっぱい食べていいから、な！", "zh": "哇，真的！？对不起，德莉子、风花！\n柠檬你们尽管吃个够啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "7d55331045692c72cecdfc034a42df05de1a0a60e86905bb0aa420dfbc716998", "ja": "はあ～。ステージ、すっげー広かったよな～。\nなんかオレ、もうドキドキしてきたよ！", "zh": "哈啊～。舞台真是超——大啊～。\n我已经开始心跳加速了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "5ec971ff46d6b409d571562c91d1e9b3a09c56e9b1a2c2abd2734eb03f4ebfa4", "ja": "アタシも！　ステージも客席も、全部大きいし。\n思いっきり、ぶつかっていけそうだよね！", "zh": "我也是！舞台和观众席都好大啊。感觉可以放开手脚尽情冲上去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ea52f91c385e332c027a53b884b0b71b7ac74a4dc44bc90f2b7a26240a650fdc", "ja": "二人ともすごいなぁ……。私は緊張してきちゃった。\nこんなに大きな会場は初めてだし……。", "zh": "你们两个都好厉害啊……我开始紧张起来了。\n毕竟，这么大的会场我还是第一次来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "a66adb6ca2551589d0238b60e0a9306fd2834f48edff537c670f35440ad58333", "ja": "それはそうなんだよなー。{$P$}、\nここって劇場何個分なんだ？　4個分くらいか？", "zh": "确实是这样啊——。{$P$}，\n这里相当于几个剧场那么大？大概有4个剧场那么大？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ef73f88375dcc39bbdae93d3366f3ff2989a3d848cc1c8ba190805c26d7b5c8e", "ja": "うーん、客席の数でいうなら……\n何十個分、っていうレベルかな？", "zh": "嗯——要是按座位数来算的话……\n大概相当于几十个剧场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "b9f9f68ef2566cc8b270f9cfff187e2c041e9df77855128e111d7a4b8989082a", "ja": "何十個！？　マジかよ……。\nうう、そう言われると、たしかに緊張してきたかも～？", "zh": "几十个！？真的假的……  \n呜呜，你这么一说，我好像确实开始紧张了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "c89c5c6f3730abfc091a88ad3d8331b7c568237743525977f7f2edabf8b69853", "ja": "ん～、でも考えようによってはさ。アタシ達、39人も\nいるんだから。39個分までは大丈夫じゃない？", "zh": "嗯～不过换个角度想想嘛。我们可是有39个人呢。到39个为止，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e8deb29cc7bf8d4b5d1c5216673fc35f27ddd87bb755811609035d9944b060ce", "ja": "39人……ふふっ、そっか。あのステージには、\n1人じゃなくて……みんなと一緒に立つんだよね。", "zh": "39个人……呵呵，也是呢。那个舞台，\n不是只有1个人……而是和大家一起站上去的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1024_p", "source_sha256": "597ad50ac49f44a0e8e16a01fc2f04351f87cf9c8b8ce938064a65ac22cc4263", "ja": "そうだよ。それに今回は、アイフェスから\nオファーが来たから、出ることになったんだ。", "zh": "是啊。而且这次是因为偶像节向我们发来了邀约，所以才决定参加的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1025_p", "source_sha256": "cccb14c5ccce1061749edb59906e193ca2fc3343a38dfc44362ea58f20eff4ad", "ja": "みんなはもう、あのステージにふさわしいって\n認めてもらえてる、ってことかな。", "zh": "也就是说，大家已经得到了认可，\n被认为完全配得上那个舞台了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d5bb660202cfce8ed699e4564a753b9f4527f72c01f95b0f27dcef286720836f", "ja": "私たちが……！", "zh": "我们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "2845c489803f7910cd350edfb5fbe72cd84cd96e8007d540940782eca0e12fc0", "ja": "あはは、なんかくすぐったいね！\nでも……うん。なんか、ますます燃えてきたかも！", "zh": "啊哈哈，总觉得怪不好意思的呢！\n不过……嗯。感觉越来越燃起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f02dc4bddbdd4cc1ea7d621aa378921197e80407281b2aa772fc3fae621435e", "ja": "よーし！　{$P$}、\nオレ忘れ物したから、もっかいステージに行ってくる！", "zh": "好——！{$P$}，\n我忘了东西，再去一趟舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2ca41c61985e3c18aee5ce4d53eea3966b9ff2024e999d974f80568bd10ed2f7", "ja": "え、また？\nというか、ステージに忘れ物ってなんだ？", "zh": "咦，又来？\n话说，忘在舞台上的东西到底是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "45ecfac516d6bb6ab15c8fb9bd823e29bd3107b612459ab3d63affb84801f159", "ja": "えへへ、予告ホームラン♪\nステージから客席に向かって、決めてくるよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，预告全垒打♪\n我要从舞台朝观众席打过去，一举拿下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "5e9771ac1059ffd37f3e4ff040a0b930dd89a96f0235016e783846b3276c2720", "ja": "うーん、いいねえ昴！　じゃあアタシも、\nKO予告でもしとこうかな。ほらほら、風花さんもっ！", "zh": "嗯——不错嘛，昴！那我也来预告一下KO好了。来嘛来嘛，风花姐也一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12bcbcbfef6367748717c3351705505a9dc686020dc680fe9261e817897c7fd1", "ja": "ええっ？　う、うん、じゃあ私も思いきって！\nでも、私の予告って……看護……ああっ、違う違う！", "zh": "诶？呃、嗯，那我也豁出去试试！\n不过，我的预告是……护理……啊！不对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
