{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "e4f710655975ac33a5cb775dfead2729020d85f092e5481550a748bafe3d5880", "ja": "ふふっ、昴ちゃんの手作りだそうですよ。\nとっても優しい味ですね～。", "zh": "呵呵，据说这是昴亲手做的呢。\n味道特别温和呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "ddda93ba274a9d3f12dc37d8b687de21b03b83e2823f5e3c137ca31ab0757f71", "ja": "こ、琴葉さんが用意してくれたアイスも、\nすごく、美味しいです……♪", "zh": "琴、琴叶准备的冰淇淋，也特别好吃……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
