{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "6e61c21e2f1eefabe22db3b7426cb1967dd1fbd8c631da5dd4f64f48c07680ae", "ja": "あ、あの……。琴葉さん？\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，那个……琴叶小姐？\n您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "5328f7bff16bb41fc8399c0ed910001f976ebbed82b76fd121b8c6ff5a275b52", "ja": "あっ、可憐さん、ごめんなさい。\n少し気になることがあって……。", "zh": "啊，可怜，对不起。只是有件事让我有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "d41a74997078993689daba699d2221dd0461edf4d334185daa19d5aaa44b4a51", "ja": "みんな、ミスも減ってきたし、タイミングも\n合ってきたけど……これでいいのかな、って……。", "zh": "大家的失误越来越少，节拍也\n越来越合得来了……可这样真的就可以了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "004c0e97264aecc38070968c4ff3effdd0ceb521851cad977e8713db217a342a", "ja": "へえ、琴葉もか。あたしも違和感があるんだよなー。\nこう、なんか物足りないっていうか。", "zh": "诶，琴叶也有这种感觉啊。我也觉得有点不对劲——总感觉，好像还缺了点什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd23db959ffa8b239de4b5a0cf91f13bc33c1f4091254207e02cef50077a4228", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんも……やっぱり、そうだよね。\n私の指示に問題があるのかな……。", "zh": "茱莉亚也……果然也是这样呢。\n是我的指示有问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "eff7965779d6fc347bc432bafc7bafd1de3915142961eb4a4c2a34a783adde10", "ja": "そんなことはありませんよ～。\n琴葉さんの指示は、とても的確だと思います～。", "zh": "不是那回事哦～  \n我觉得琴叶小姐的指示非常准确～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1045_045kar", "source_sha256": "46cf6922e8b85788c09b50f4a4686962fca91db5ad7358e09500d01172e68a18", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さんも、\n何かが足りないって……思いますか？", "zh": "那个……你也觉得{$P$}先生好像还缺少些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1046_p", "source_sha256": "360e6f4e6d1fbfe63d946548332917f0aa8b5742fe4bedea5d51f504314ea5d2", "ja": "パフォーマンスに大きな問題はないと思うよ。\nでも、足りないとしたら……イメージの調整、かな。", "zh": "我觉得表演本身没什么大问题。\n不过，要说缺少什么的话……也许是调整一下形象吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "ddbe1eb2bdf381de231ff6b2bc4a07ee8ad672ddd30d04e903633e6f097b7224", "ja": "イメージの調整、ですか？", "zh": "调整形象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "e2a0e87a5a4714a826790bc60749d3cc9e74c5a62de3b513edcc691d1a33df47", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？　曖昧な言い方\nばかりしていると、お仕置ですからね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？　要是老是\n含糊其辞的话，可是要受到惩罚的哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1049_p", "source_sha256": "0cb7e8237550de3b7286419431ef2d8322bad92a3ca6816009d0f60cf22b971a", "ja": "わ、わかってるよ。つまり、みんな会場を下見した\nばかりだから、実はイメージが湧いてるんだと思う。", "zh": "我、我知道啦。也就是说，大家才刚去现场踩过点，所以其实已经有画面了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1050_p", "source_sha256": "561da614e0e0d8d3ce24ff4aeb876ceb7ed2dc1a1ebd2005de1f228b43950f3a", "ja": "あの大きな会場全部を埋め尽くす、\n本番での、大観衆の興奮と高まりを。", "zh": "想像着在那座巨大的场馆里座无虚席，\n正式演出时广大观众内心的兴奋与激昂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "eef46df04e97100265b2e8e32046ca626fdcad1bfe694e28adaad1e9331ac2b5", "ja": "興奮と、高まり……。", "zh": "兴奋和高涨的情绪……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "0c8451ae790aa13ab1fa370cfa38955bec4bc8f043da6400f9a735e7a5526b59", "ja": "ああ、なるほど！\nそういうことなら、足りないワケだ！", "zh": "啊，原来如此！\n既然是这样，那确实是不够啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "9df07675213d3a9c9b07a4b2c81f9e7cd9f3d667f8d5a76518725f62c358bf53", "ja": "あの、ジュリアさん……？", "zh": "那个，茱莉亚先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "4044e081dafc0e3cdb4ba93cd8b51b1b154c4b932fd6f72e4d88a1a21447f0d0", "ja": "下見をした時のウチらには、本番での客席が見えてた。\nでも今のウチらは、それを見てなかった。", "zh": "之前来踩点的时候，我们已经看到了正式演出时的观众席。可是现在的我们，却没能看到它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1055_017kth", "source_sha256": "5d9d9f24f3d4593433a1bd9c740f240599eeb3e62dfb95073968598b1396c89c", "ja": "そっか……パフォーマンスを綺麗にまとめるだけじゃ、\n今の私たちのイメージに……追いつかないのかも！", "zh": "原来如此……光是把表演编排得漂亮，可能还不足以……跟上现在我们的形象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1056_045kar", "source_sha256": "b26361b80e82a3dc0bfddb00d4fe61973b1d64eb432fe8b7e6b8b50b20d18ca0", "ja": "あ……。あの会場で、本番のステージに立っている……\n本気でそう思わなくちゃ、ダメだったんですね……。", "zh": "啊……必须发自内心地相信，自己正站在那个会场的正式舞台上……\n才行啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1057_031tom", "source_sha256": "9473fff906efd90ea4f29831161057d29ee136869d00941331ae2ea299497e7e", "ja": "たしかに、子豚ちゃん達の声が大きいほど、\n聖母の愛も大きくなりますからね～。", "zh": "确实，猪仔们的声音越响亮，圣母的爱也会越深厚呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1058_031tom", "source_sha256": "fc6661b66c637daa561c844f76fee672d974dd4d436756791fa28aa0124f7ccc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、なかなかいい\n指摘でしたよ～。褒めてあげます～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你的意见\n提得相当不错哦～。我要好好夸夸你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1059_p", "source_sha256": "6604fb56a7266d0e07baaea0ee4291f3b5fedf2882c65191ed55a7c130b1c7a1", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……。そういうことだから、\n今のパフォーマンスとしては十分……", "zh": "啊，谢谢……正因为如此，就目前的表现来说已经足够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1060_017kth", "source_sha256": "18f67c8fe083934459de1021ca6d4948c7da488020e3cbe888a73c17d54fd23e", "ja": "それじゃ、みんな！　今のが本番だとしたら\nどう改善していくか、意見を聞かせてくれないかな？", "zh": "那么，大家！如果刚才的表现就是正式演出，接下来该如何改进呢？能听听你们的意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1061_031tom", "source_sha256": "63f17830f30fd4809fe9e58d24d5cc7961da85299e08abd43469822237d49ed7", "ja": "私は、立ち位置を変えた方がいいかもしれませんね～。\n子豚ちゃん達の顔が、もっと見えた方がいいですから♪", "zh": "或许我该换一下站位呢～。这样就能更清楚地看到小猪猪们的脸了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1062_050jul", "source_sha256": "da074d0661a002263f96aa6fa5de0a18e5a31b14491a8dbfc9b5c42a0f1cc844", "ja": "全員で歌うパート、もう少し増やしてもいいかもな。\nバーンと盛り上がるトコだし、力強くさ。", "zh": "全员一起唱的部分，或许可以再增加一点。毕竟是能一下子炒热气氛的地方，要唱得更有力量嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1063_045kar", "source_sha256": "78fcedfa2c191461de2490ab11df5340f7d51cdeaa22471762f7c270d2cb6de8", "ja": "あ、あの……サビのところ、もっと大きく動くと……\nみ、みなさんからも、よく見えるかも、って……。", "zh": "啊，那个……副歌的部分，要是动作幅度再大一些……大家也许也能看得更清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_1064_017kth", "source_sha256": "905cd65d2d2b06e9dd580e3e0e41ea0a2c5c95a0991cf1b54768c3fe30e6ab7d", "ja": "私も、綺麗なフォーメーションにこだわらない方が\nいい気がしているの。先生に相談してみようかな……。", "zh": "我也觉得，还是不要拘泥于漂亮的队形比较好。要不要去和制作人商量一下呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
