{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_2003_031tom", "source_sha256": "5bfcc5f1a9190c1c38e4ad69336e272a6f839ade3f3a33a08d3afac5c1a3cb5e", "ja": "うふふ、とても素敵なステージになりそうですね～。\n聖母の愛を、客席のすみずみまで届けられそうです～♪", "zh": "呵呵，感觉会成为一场非常棒的舞台呢～。\n圣母的爱，好像也能传达到观众席的每一个角落了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_2004_045kar", "source_sha256": "615fe498f401462cf3d36ae35872feffb9acf83ab8147d5e5ee06764e11c87d0", "ja": "わ、私も……緊張より、楽しみな気持ちのほうが、\n大きいなんて……ウソみたいです……♪", "zh": "我、我也……比起紧张，期待的心情居然更加强烈……简直像在做梦一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_2005_050jul", "source_sha256": "12f854c64745fee780c03fd3d1ca689678d14ff842e8f5ff4a7ff1e6602428b6", "ja": "こんな大舞台を用意してくれたんだ。\nアンタには、感謝しとかないとな。", "zh": "你为我准备了这么大的舞台。\n我可得好好谢谢你才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f4507ca500643321b442fc1ca3fd0b32acd435b46c0fc10a1610f12c644d2495", "ja": "いや……感謝しなくちゃいけないのは、\n応援してくれるファンのみんなに、だよ。", "zh": "不……真正该感谢的，\n是一直支持着你们的粉丝大家才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_054_2007_p", "source_sha256": "d87564c446bf0c4e364ae5b3d3bf9c1c1b619e7e3cfe4f289cc1212fd04ef7ef", "ja": "ファンに向き合ってきた思いの積み重ねが、\nアイフェスの参加に繋がったんだから。", "zh": "正是因为一直认真面对粉丝、不断积累下来的心意，才促成了参加偶像祭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
